_publ_section_synopsis
;
In the racemic title compound, the [Co(en)~3~]^3+^ and [Na(H~2~O)~6~]^+^cations
exist in distorted octahedral coordination environments and charge neutrality
in the salt is furnished by Cl^-^ anions. Structural cohesion is maintained by
an array of C---H<b>...</b>O, N---H<b>...</b>Cl and O---H<b>...</b>Cl hydrogen
bonds.
;
